# Build context for the api image is the repo root (see docker-compose.yml).
# Exclude everything, then allow only what apps/api/Dockerfile.prod COPYs.
# (apps/web builds with its own context, apps/web, so this file does not affect it.)
*

!apps/api/pyproject.toml
!apps/api/app
!infra/vuln-labs/appsec-lab
!infra/vuln-labs/serverless-lab
!infra/vuln-labs/serverless-lab-template.tf

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
